# Independent source-neutral kernel facade. The implementation is private and the explicit public
# API is kept in one module so standalone adversarial harnesses depend only on stable entry points.
# The replay core is ordered by the kernel language it implements: terms, bounds, facts,
# quantifiers, tactic transitions, congruence, arithmetic, and resource certificates.
